{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51773","headline":"承清隐命访刘处士已殁因吊以诗 · 詹琲","name":"承清隐命访刘处士已殁因吊以诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤髻山前凤阁郎，耕云钓石久荒凉。\n我来吊旧多悲感，一纸哀辞酹一觞。\n（《嘉靖安溪县志》七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹琲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}